                                "sense_id": "b5303f74-6ff0-318a-b00e-f9d0b0800eb8",
                                "text": "De filmploeg was enthousiast bezig met het opnemen van de scène.",
                                "translation": "The film crew was enthusiastically shooting the scene.",
                                "english": "The film crew was enthusiastically shooting the scene."
                            },
