                                "sense_id": "b5303f74-6ff0-318a-b00e-f9d0b0800eb8",
                                "text": "De regisseur overlegde met de filmploeg over de volgende opnames.",
                                "translation": "The director discussed the next shots with the film crew.",
                                "english": "The director discussed the next shots with the film crew."
                            },
                            {
